## 🎭 INTERACTIVE STORIES (Multi-Character, Level 3-4 Only)


### Story System Architecture

```typescript
interface Story {
  id: string;
  title: string;          // Arabic title
  titleEn: string;        // French/English title
  description: string;
  level: 3 | 4;          // Advanced only
  duration: number;       // Estimated minutes
  characters: Character[];
  scenes: Scene[];
  achievements: Achievement[];
}

interface Character {
  id: string;
  name: string;          // Arabic name
  nameEn: string;        // French name
  role: string;          // 'taxi_driver', 'vendor', 'police', etc.
  personality: string;   // 'friendly', 'grumpy', 'helpful', 'rushed'
  dialect: 'msa' | 'darija';
  
  // Visual (halal-compliant)
  avatar: {
    type: 'svg' | 'lottie';
    file: string;        // Path to avatar file
    headShape: 'sphere' | 'oval'; // NO face
    accessories: string[]; // ['hat', 'uniform', 'scarf']
    dominantColor: string; // e.g., '#FFD700' for taxi
  };
  
  // Audio
  ambientSound?: string; // Character-specific sound (optional)
}

interface Scene {
  id: string;
  sceneNumber: number;
  location: string;      // Arabic location name
  locationEn: string;    // French location name
  background: {
    image: string;       // Background image path
    style: 'realistic' | 'illustrated' | 'minimal';
  };
  audio: SceneAudio;
  activeCharacter: string; // Character ID
  objectives: string[];  // What user should accomplish
  nextScene: string | ((userChoices: string[]) => string); // Next scene or branching
}

interface SceneAudio {
  background: string;    // Loop ambient sound
  character?: string;    // Character-specific sound
  events: {
    trigger: string;     // Event name
    sound: string;       // Sound file
    volume: number;      // 0-1
  }[];
}

interface Achievement {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  description: string;
  icon: string;
  condition: (storyState: any) => boolean;
}
```

### Character Visual Design (Halal-Compliant)

**MANDATORY RULES:**
- NO facial features (eyes, mouth, nose)
- Head = simple geometric shape (sphere, oval, glowing orb)
- Body = minimalist silhouette
- Identity through: clothing, accessories, colors, posture

